<section class="section section--white">
  <div class="container--narrow">
    <div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">How do we become a normal country again?</div>
    <p class="intro-text">
      To become a 'normal' country — where we have control over our own affairs like the economy, defence, treaties and associations, energy, borders, relationships with other countries — to have the controls, freedoms and choices that countries like Ireland, Finland, Denmark, Iceland and the Netherlands take for granted, we need to leave the UK — the Union.
    </p>
    <p class="intro-text">
      We tried to leave the UK in 2014 and failed. But a re-run of the 2014 referendum — even if one were 'granted' — is never going to be the way out of the UK. The British State will simply not allow it. We will never get out of the UK by asking nicely. There has to be another way. Luckily for us, there is.
    </p>
    <p class="intro-text"><strong>We need to take our freedom. Take, don't ask. That's what this website is all about.</strong></p>
    <a href="/how-the-uk-came-to-be/" class="btn btn-gold">Start Here: How the Union Came To Be</a>
  </div>
</section>

